@description ReaPackLabSetup: bootstrap installer for centrally managed ReaPackLab
@author ReaLab
@version 0.1.0
@changelog
  Stable-channel distribution of v0.1.0-dev.2 macOS ARM64 bootstrap (same binary; not rebuilt).
@provides
  [darwin-arm64] reaper_reapacklabsetup-arm64.dylib https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLabSetup/releases/download/v$version/$path
@link
  Distribution repository https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLabSetup
  Managed ReaPackLab extension https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLab
@about
  # ReaPackLabSetup

  ReaPackLabSetup bootstraps the centrally managed ReaPackLab extension for
  REAPER installations. It is a separate native extension, not a replacement
  for ReaPackLab.

  This development build is for macOS Apple Silicon (ARM64). Restart REAPER
  after Setup installs the main extension so that it can load.

  Test in a clean REAPER installation before classroom deployment.

  Based on ReaPack by Christian Fillion (LGPL-3.0-or-later).
